  "description": "Stylized Pirate Ship with hold for your game or project. The ship also comes with a few props: cannon, box, barrel and pallet.\n\nFeatures: <br>\n- PBR workflow (metallic/roughness).<br>\n- The glow of the sails is only in the emission texture map. You can turn it on and off as you like.<br>\n- Ship uses 6 PBR materials, texture maps 2k size;<br>\n UV mapping: Yes, overlapping;<br>\n\nTriangle count: Stylized Pirate Ship: 17966 tris; Cannon: 1396 tris; Barrel: 428 tris; Box: 120 tris.\n\nDo not use two-sided polygon mapping. This is not required. I have duplicated and inverted polygons where required.\n\nI hope you will enjoy my product! If you have questions about this model or you have a problem send me:<br>\nArtstation: www.artstation.com/comeback   <br>\nEmail: c3posw@mail.ru<br>\nI believe this world is beautiful and all problems can be solved!",
